### 2. Thieu token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/students

### 3. Student xoa student -> 403
DELETE {{host}}/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Student sua student khac -> 403
PUT {{host}}/api/students/999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "programmeId": 1,
  "studentCode": "TEST999",
  "fullName": "Doi ten nguoi khac",
  "email": "test999@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "2003-01-01",
  "yearOfEntry": 2026,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
